02.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"曹總已離開TVB。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/767d85b30f3f61705810ab139cd4971b/2023-03/tso_ig_7.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"劉一飛從2012年《愛．回家》開始，飾演「曹總」一角。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6c259c872d5894e318d2b706f3f75d1f/2023-03/2012_1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鍾凱琪憑《愛．回家》「池美麗」一角入屋。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1959bee147b8ef19d26ca53d1fac3ada/2024-06/yukimi_chung_1600007894_2397362434210889096_1980838254.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鍾凱琪在《愛．回家》曾與金城安有短暫「情緣」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/abd08ad9f781713eb9ce8c881da1ce2c/2024-06/yukimi_chung_1557761889_2042977259111026788_1980838254.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張漢斌(現名張韡騰)曾於小紅書上載影片，期間大展歌喉，自彈自唱。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2166ca380d72084a38223d2b61801059/2024-10/vlcsnap-2024-10-08-21h56m25s530_0.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"張漢斌(現名張韡騰)曾在電影《東成西就》，有幸與張國榮合作。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e04be3f272a238f989bffd231dade43c/2024-07/17332964_1289854251110820_6176867938990030848_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張漢斌(現名張韡騰)在《愛‧回家》演出大力一角。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e8b8146b0d212827ed05f520dd7b6570/2024-07/30085692_2074420032834453_889529624407572480_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"秦啟維離巢前特別多謝劉丹。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/439fb8f421148c9dddc8a018ad6f1348/2025-12/waiwai223_1764853801_3780190125402419231_27094347.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"「面油」羅永健與「書蟲」林浩文先後離巢。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/306cb470bdc764b86d9762e201985934/2023-08/omanlhm_319305366_126556846932586_6043346655586642202_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳卓衡在《愛．回家》飾演金城安好友的島大同學「頭皮」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7bff471a2bbc7e6dd3ce07d7eb490b6b/2025-07/5_33.jpg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-23T22:43:53.050204+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1443,"images":88,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"unknown"}}